                Silexion Therapeutics Corp 2024 Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;<span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-weight: bold;">2024 Plan</span>&#8221;), effective as of January 1, 2026, to increase the number of
                ordinary shares added annually on January 1st under the &#8220;evergreen&#8221; provision of Section 5(b)(i) of the 2024 Plan from (i) 5% of the Company&#8217;s issued and outstanding ordinary shares, to (ii) such number of ordinary shares as yields a pool
                of ordinary shares reserved under all equity incentive plans of the Company that constitutes, in the aggregate, 10% of the issued and outstanding ordinary shares on a fully diluted basis (the &#8220;<span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-weight: bold;">Evergreen Increase Proposal</span>&#8221;).</div>
